---
import LegalPage from '../../../layouts/LegalPage.astro';
import t from '../../../data/en.json';
import site from '../../../data/site.json';
---
<LegalPage locale="en" t={t} title="Privacy Policy" slug="privacy" altSlug="datenschutz">
  <p>
    This policy explains which data is processed when you visit this website. It is based on
    the Swiss Data Protection Act (revDSG) and, where applicable, the European General Data
    Protection Regulation (GDPR).
  </p>
  <h2>Controller</h2>
  <p>
    Ebmeyer Consulting, Nadine Ebmeyer, Langackerstrasse 11, 6330 Cham ZG, Switzerland.<br />
    Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>
  </p>
  <h2>No cookies</h2>
  <p>
    This website sets <strong>no cookies</strong> and stores no data on your device. No
    visitor profiles are created, and there is no cross-device or cross-site tracking. This
    is why the site needs no cookie banner.
  </p>

  <h2>Audience measurement with Plausible Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    For simple audience measurement this site uses <strong>Plausible Analytics</strong>, a
    privacy-friendly service operated by Plausible Insights OÜ, Estonia. Collection and
    storage take place exclusively on servers within the European Union. No analytics data is
    transferred to the United States.
  </p>
  <p>Only aggregated, anonymous information is recorded:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>pages viewed and the number of views</li>
    <li>referring website, such as a search engine or LinkedIn</li>
    <li>country, derived from the IP address</li>
    <li>device type, browser and operating system</li>
    <li>clicks on external links, such as the booking link</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    <strong>Your IP address is not stored.</strong> It is used only briefly, together with a
    randomly generated value that changes every day, to produce an irreversible checksum.
    This makes it possible to count repeat visits within a single day without allowing any
    conclusion about your identity. Recognition beyond that day is not possible.
  </p>
  <p>
    The legal basis is the legitimate interest in a data-minimising statistical analysis of
    website use (Art. 31 revDSG and Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). Further information is available in
    the <a href="https://plausible.io/data-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Plausible privacy policy</a>.
  </p>
  <h2>Hosting and server log files</h2>
  <p>
    This website is hosted by {site.legal.hostName} ({site.legal.hostCountryEn}) and
    delivered through their global content delivery network. Pages are served from the
    location nearest to you, which means data may be processed outside Switzerland and the
    EU, in particular in the United States.
  </p>
  <p>
    When the website is accessed, the hosting provider processes technically necessary
    connection data such as IP address, date and time of access, page requested, browser type
    and operating system. This data serves solely the secure and stable operation of the
    website and the prevention of attacks, and is not merged with other data sources.
  </p>
  <p>
    A data processing agreement is in place with the provider. The transfer to the United
    States is based on the European Commission's Standard Contractual Clauses.
  </p>
  <p>
    The domain <strong>ebmeyer-consulting.ch</strong> is registered with
    {site.legal.registrarName} in {site.legal.registrarCountryEn}. This concerns the domain
    registration only; the content of this website is not served from there.
  </p>
  <h2>Booking a call via Calendly</h2>
  <p>
    To book an introductory call, this site links to the external service Calendly. The service
    is <strong>not embedded</strong> in this website: data is only transmitted to Calendly once
    you actively click the link and open the Calendly page. From that point, Calendly's own
    privacy policy applies (Calendly LLC, USA).
  </p>
  <h2>Getting in touch</h2>
  <p>
    If you contact us by email or phone, your details are stored in order to handle your
    enquiry and any follow-up questions. This data is not passed on without your consent.
  </p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Information about the data processed about you</li>
    <li>Correction of inaccurate data</li>
    <li>Deletion of your data</li>
    <li>Objection to processing</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Please contact <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
